--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The lane-finding, note-assembly, text-association and video-reconstruction
algorithms in this project are original work. They are built on generic
scientific-computing primitives (NumPy, SciPy, scikit-image, OpenCV) and do not
incorporate code from any existing player-piano or music-roll decoding project.

If you use perfora in academic work, please cite it — see CITATION.cff.
